[3.204115,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  An import list built from registry data\r\n  ======================================\r\n\r\n  Ze has a customer peer in AS 65001. This IRR server is a local test server.\r\n  AS-TEST contains 10.0.0.0/24, not 192.168.0.0/24.\r\n  Like bgpq4 -J -l CUSTOMER AS-CUSTOMER for Junos prefix-lists,\r\n  Ze expands an AS-SET, but refreshes its import list inside the router.\r\n"]
